<title>UK: GOLF-FALDO COMES HOME FOR WENTWORTH TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>GOLF-FALDO COMES HOME FOR WENTWORTH TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nick Faldo will make a rare European Tour appearance at the Volvo PGA Championship at Wentworth from May 23-26.</p>
<p>Faldo plays on the U.S. Tour, but he has decided to come home in a bid to win the title for a record fifth time. &quot;I've decided to come back because I know the course so well and I always enjoy playing it,'' he said.</p>
</text>
